# /etc/fw_env.config — where fw_printenv/fw_setenv (u-boot-tools) find the U-Boot
# environment. Verified from a live Luckfox Pico Pro Max (SPI-NAND): the env is a
# standard CRC32+data U-Boot environment in the dedicated "env" MTD partition
# (mtd0), single copy, written 0x00 through the whole 256 KB partition.
#
#   MTD device   Device offset   Env. size   Flash sector size
/dev/mtd0        0x0             0x40000     0x20000
